<title>PHILIPPINES: SanMig pulls down Manila shares at close.</title>
<headline>SanMig pulls down Manila shares at close.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>A selldown in blue chip San Miguel Corp weighed Philippine shares down by almost one percent at close, brokers said.</p>
<p>A price cut in San Miguel's major beer products sparked a wave of selling as investors saw it affecting its operating margin, Wilfred Son Keng Po, chief operating officer of Angping Securities, said.</p>
<p>San Miguel on Sunday announced a 1.50 peso price cut in its major beer product, a move which the company said will help reverse its declining sales volume.</p>
</text>
